  [MeasureTheory.IsProbabilityMeasure P] [MeasureTheory.IsProbabilityMeasure P']
  {A : Learning.IdentAlg Unit 𝓐 𝓨 𝓓} {O : ℕ → Ω → Unit} {X : ℕ → Ω → 𝓐} {Y : ℕ → Ω → 𝓨}
